hover:backdrop-blur-none md:hover:bg-primary-100 transition-all duration-300"><div class="flex items-center justify-between p-3"><a href="/" class="flex items-center z-10 transform translate-x-3 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary-950 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 rounded" aria-label="Beeldzorgteam home"><svg viewBox="0 0 2900 300" fill="none" width="280" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="transition-colors text-primary-950 hover:text-primary-900" data-v-b67484bd=""><text x="0" y="50%" dominant-baseline="central" text-anchor="start" font-family="system-ui, sans-serif" font-weight="900" font-size="260" fill="currentColor" letter-spacing="0">BEELDZORGTEAM.NL</text></svg></a><nav class="w-fit flex flex-row items-center gap-1 hidden md:flex" role="navigation" aria-label="Desktopnavigatie" data-v-cc455ec7><button class="z-10 relative inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-4 py-3 leading-none text-primary-900 no-underline text-sm font-medium transition-colors rounded-full nav-link transform active:scale-95 after:absolute after:left-0 after:right-0 after:top-full after:h-4 after:content-[&#39;&#39;] bg-primary-200" aria-haspopup="true" aria-expanded="false" data-v-cc455ec7> Platform <span class="iconify i-ph:zorgt-down w-3.5 h-3.5 transition-transform duration-200" aria-hidden="true" style="" data-v-cc455ec7></span></button><button class="z-10 relative inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-4 py-3 leading-none text-primary-900 no-underline text-sm font-medium transition-colors rounded-full nav-link transform active:scale-95 after:absolute after:left-0 after:right-0 after:top-full after:h-4 after:content-[&#39;&#39;]" aria-haspopup="true" aria-expanded="false" data-v-cc455ec7> Toepassingen <span class="iconify i-ph:zorgt-down w-3.5 h-3.5 transition-transform duration-200" aria-hidden="true" style="" data-v-cc455ec7></span></button><a href="/partners" class="z-10 relative inline-block px-4 py-3 leading-none  text-primary-900 no-underline text-sm font-medium transition-colors rounded-full nav-link transform active:scale-95 hover:bg-primary-200" aria-label="Navigeer naar Partners" data-v-cc455ec7>Partners</a><a href="/contact" class="z-10 relative inline-block px-4 py-3 leading-none  text-primary-900 no-underline text-sm font-medium transition-colors rounded-full nav-link transform active:scale-95 bg-primary-950 !text-primary-50 ml-2" aria-label="Navigeer naar Contact met ons opnemen" data-v-cc455ec7>Contact</a><!----></nav><button class="md:hidden p-2 rounded-md transition-colors z-10 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 text-primary-950 hover:text-primary-800 hover:bg-primary-100 focus-visible:ring-primary-950" aria-label="Toggle menu" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="mobile-navigation"><div class="w-6 h-6 relative flex items-center justify-center"><span class="absolute w-5 h-0.5 bg-current rounded-full transition-all duration-300 ease-out -translate-y-1"></span><span class="absolute w-5 h-0.5 bg-current rounded-full transition-all duration-300 ease-out translate-y-1"></span></div></button></div></div></nav><!----><!--]--><div class="min-h-screen bg-primary-50"><section class="py-8 md:py-24 pt-24 pb-8 md:pb-16 md:pt-40"><!--[--><div class="w-full max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4"><!--[--><div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center"><!----><div class="mb-4"><span class="inline-block font-medium rounded-full bg-primary-100 text-primary-800 px-3 py-1 text-xs">Technologie</span></div><h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl tracking-tight font-medium text-primary-950 mb-6 text-balance">Bouw beeldzorg momenten die cliënten écht gebruiken</h1><p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-primary-700 text-balance mb-8">Creëer korte, interactieve contactmomenten die vragen en inhoud combineren. Geleverd via SMS, e-mail of weblink, geen app vereist.</p><div><!--[--><a href="/contact" class="cursor-pointer leading-none inline-flex items-center justify-center font-medium transition-all focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 whitespace-nowrap px-4 py-3 md:py-3 bg-primary-950 text-primary-50 rounded-full hover:bg-primary-900 focus-visible:ring-primary-950 active:scale-95 text-base"><!--[--> Neem contact op <!--]--><!----></a><!--]--></div></div><!--]--><!----></div><!--]--></section><section class="py-8 md:py-24"><!--[--><div class="w-full max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4"><!--[--><div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto"><div class="w-full"><div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:items-start lg:justify-between gap-2 lg:gap-6 text-pretty"><div class="flex flex-col items-start text-left flex-1"><span class="inline-block font-medium rounded-full bg-primary-100 text-primary-800 px-3 py-1 text-xs mb-3">Problem</span><h2 class="text-2xl md:max-w-[24ch] tracking-tight md:text-4xl font-medium text-primary-950 mb-3">Lange formulieren worden niet ingevuld. Apps kunnen niet worden gedownload.</h2><!----></div><!----></div></div><div class="mt-8 space-y-4 text-base text-primary-700"><p> De meeste digitale zorgtools vragen te veel. Lange vragenlijsten worden halverwege afgebroken. Zorgportalen vereisen inloggegevens die niemand onthoudt. </p><p> Beeldzorgteam is anders. Elk moment is een gerichte interactie van 2-5 minuten. Cliënten tikken op een link, starten een videogesprek en klaar. </p></div><div class="mt-12 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 md:gap-12"><!--[--><div class="flex flex-col text-pretty"><span class="text-3xl md:text-5xl text-primary-950 tracking-tight font-[300]">50%</span><h3 class="font-medium text-primary-900 mt-4">Chronische cliënten nemen medicatie niet in zoals medicijnen</h3><p class="text-sm text-primary-700 mt-1">Ongeveer de helft van de cliënten neemt chronische medicatie niet in zoals herhaaldelijk.</p><a href="https://www.panfoundation.org/medication-non-adherence/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline items-center gap-1 font-medium text-primary-600 hover:text-primary-950 transition-colors text-xs mt-auto tracking-tight pt-2"><!--[-->Wereldzorgorganisatie<span>, 2023</span><!--]--><span class="iconify i-ph:arrow-up-right relative transform translate-y-[2px] translate-x-[1px] w-3 h-3" aria-hidden="true" style=""></span></a></div><div class="flex flex-col text-pretty"><span class="text-3xl md:text-5xl text-primary-950 tracking-tight font-[300]">2x</span><h3 class="font-medium text-primary-900 mt-4">Direct contact verdubbelt therapietrouw</h3><p class="text-sm text-primary-700 mt-1">Onderzoek toont aan dat laagdrempelige contact, de therapietrouw verdubbelt en de betrokkenheid vergroot.</p><a href="https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC12096470/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline items-center gap-1 font-medium text-primary-600 hover:text-primary-950 transition-colors text-xs mt-auto tracking-tight pt-2"><!--[-->PMC / a:zorg Congress<span>, 2024</span><!--]--><span class="iconify i-ph:arrow-up-right relative transform translate-y-[2px] translate-x-[1px] w-3 h-3" aria-hidden="true" style=""></span></a></div><div class="flex flex-col text-pretty"><span class="text-3xl md:text-5xl text-primary-950 tracking-tight font-[300]">48%</span><h3 class="font-medium text-primary-900 mt-4">Cliënten in de thuiszorg voelen zich vaak eenzaam</h3><p class="text-sm text-primary-700 mt-1">Een groot deel van de ouderen in de thuiszorg effectieve eenzaamheid en gebrek aan dagelijks contact.</p><a href="https://www.samhsa.gov/data/report/nsduh-2024-pst-yr-mhtx-adult-adol" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline items-center gap-1 font-medium text-primary-600 hover:text-primary-950 transition-colors text-xs mt-auto tracking-tight pt-2"><!--[-->SAMHSA NSDUH<span>, 2024</span><!--]--><span class="iconify i-ph:arrow-up-right relative transform translate-y-[2px] translate-x-[1px] w-3 h-3" aria-hidden="true" style=""></span></a></div><!--]--></div></div><!--]--><!----></div><!--]--></section><section class="py-8 md:py-24"><!--[--><div class="w-full max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 mb-12 md:mb-16"><!--[--><div class="w-full"><div class="flex flex-col items-center text-balance"><div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center"><!----><h2 class="text-2xl md:max-w-[24ch] tracking-tight md:text-4xl font-medium text-primary-950 mb-3">Eén keer inrichten, overal beschikbaar</h2><p class="text-base text-primary-700 md:max-w-[60ch] text-balance">Bouw beeldzorgtrajecten visueel, bekijk ze direct en lever ze via alle kanalen.</p></div><div class="mt-6"><!--[--><a href="/contact" class="cursor-pointer leading-none inline-flex items-center justify-center font-medium transition-all focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 whitespace-nowrap px-4 py-3 md:py-3 bg-primary-950 text-primary-50 rounded-full hover:bg-primary-900 focus-visible:ring-primary-950 active:scale-95 text-sm"><!--[-->Neem contact op<!--]--><!----></a><!--]--></div></div></div><!--]--><!----></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-8 md:gap-16 w-full"><div class="w-full max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4"><!--[--><div class="space-y-16 md:space-y-24 w-full"><!--[--><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 lg:gap-20 items-center"><div class="max-w-md"><span class="inline-block font-medium rounded-full bg-primary-100 text-primary-800 px-3 py-1 text-xs mb-4">Screen Builder</span><h3 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-medium text-primary-950 mb-4 text-pretty">Vragen, content en beeldbellen in één flow</h3><p class="text-base text-primary-700 text-balance">Combineer welzijnsvragen, media en veilige videogesprekken. Elk scherm is gebouwd voor optimale betrokkenheid.</p><!----></div><figure class=""><div class="bg-primary-100 rounded-xl aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden"><img data-nuxt-img srcset="/_amplify/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ftelehealth_video_call_workflow_1.jpg&amp;w=1536&amp;q=100 1x, /_amplify/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ftelehealth_video_call_workflow_2.jpg&amp;w=1536&amp;q=100 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute(&#39;data-error&#39;, 1)" alt="Vragen, content en beeldbellen in één flow" class="w-full h-full object-contain" src="/_amplify/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ftelehealth_video_call_workflow_3.jpg&amp;w=1536&amp;q=100"></div></figure></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 lg:gap-20 items-center"><div class="md:order-2 max-w-md"><span class="inline-block font-medium rounded-full bg-primary-100 text-primary-800 px-3 py-1 text-xs mb-4">Skip Logic</span><h3 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-medium text-primary-950 mb-4 text-pretty">Elk antwoord bepaalt het vervolg</h3><p class="text-base text-primary-700 text-balance">Voeg logica toe aan elk scherm. Stuur cliënten naar de juiste zorgverlener op basis van hun antwoorden.</p><!----></div><figure class="md:order-1"><div class="bg-primary-100 rounded-xl aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden"><img data-nuxt-img srcset="/_amplify/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ftelehealth_video_call_workflow_4.jpg&amp;w=1536&amp;q=100 1x, /_amplify/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ftelehealth_video_call_workflow_1.jpg&amp;w=1536&amp;q=100 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute(&#39;data-error&#39;, 1)" alt="Elk antwoord bepaalt het vervolg" class="w-full h-full object-contain" src="/_amplify/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ftelehealth_video_call_workflow_1.jpg&amp;w=1536&amp;q=100"></div></figure></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 lg:gap-20 items-center"><div class="max-w-md"><span class="inline-block font-medium rounded-full bg-primary-100 text-primary-800 px-3 py-1 text-xs mb-4">Symptomen volgen</span><h3 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-medium text-primary-950 mb-4 text-pretty">Gestructureerde signalering bij elk antwoord</h3><p class="text-base text-primary-700 text-balance">Koppel schermen aan risicoprofielen. Antwoorden worden automatisch verwarmd zodat zorgverleners directe trends kunnen zien.</p><!----></div><figure class=""><div class="bg-primary-100 rounded-xl aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden"><img data-nuxt-img srcset="/_amplify/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ftelehealth_video_call_workflow_2.jpg&amp;w=1536&amp;q=100 1x, /_amplify/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ftelehealth_video_call_workflow_3.jpg&amp;w=1536&amp;q=100 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute(&#39;data-error&#39;, 1)" alt="Gestructureerde signalering bij elk antwoord" class="w-full h-full object-contain" src="/_amplify/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ftelehealth_video_call_workflow_4.jpg&amp;w=1536&amp;q=100"></div></figure></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 lg:gap-20 items-center"><div class="md:order-2 max-w-md"><span class="inline-block font-medium rounded-full bg-primary-100 text-primary-800 px-3 py-1 text-xs mb-4">Coming soon</span><h3 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-medium text-primary-950 mb-4 text-pretty">Oefeningen die cliënten direct kunnen uitvoeren</h3><p class="text-base text-primary-700 text-balance">Begeleide oefeningen en dagelijkse check-ins. Cliënten oefenen direct in de veilige omgeving zonder extra apps te hoeven installeren.</p><!----></div><figure class="md:order-1"><div class="bg-primary-100 rounded-xl aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden"><img data-nuxt-img srcset="/_amplify/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ftelehealth_video_call_workflow_1.jpg&amp;w=1536&amp;q=100 1x, /_amplify/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ftelehealth_video_call_workflow_1.jpg&amp;w=1536&amp;q=100 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute(&#39;data-error&#39;, 1)" alt="Oefeningen die cliënten direct kunnen uitvoeren" class="w-full h-full object-contain" src="/_amplify/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ftelehealth_video_call_workflow_2.jpg&amp;w=1536&amp;q=100"></div></figure></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 lg:gap-20 items-center"><div class="max-w-md"><span class="inline-block font-medium rounded-full bg-primary-100 text-primary-800 px-3 py-1 text-xs mb-4">Responsive</span><h3 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-medium text-primary-950 mb-4 text-pretty">Geoptimaliseerd voor elk scherm, geen app vereist</h3><p class="text-base text-primary-700 text-balance">Beeldzorgteam werkt perfect op telefoons, tablets en pc's. Cliënten klikken op een link en beginnen direct. Geen wachtwoorden, geen gedoe.</p><!----></div><figure class=""><div class="bg-primary-100 rounded-xl aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden"><img data-nuxt-img srcset="/_amplify/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ftelehealth_video_call_workflow_3.jpg&amp;w=1536&amp;q=100 1x, /_amplify/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ftelehealth_video_call_workflow_4.jpg&amp;w=1536&amp;q=100 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute(&#39;data-error&#39;, 1)" alt="Geoptimaliseerd voor elk scherm, geen app vereist" class="w-full h-full object-contain" src="/_amplify/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ftelehealth_video_call_workflow_1.jpg&amp;w=1536&amp;q=100"></div></figure></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 lg:gap-20 items-center"><div class="md:order-2 max-w-md"><span class="inline-block font-medium rounded-full bg-primary-100 text-primary-800 px-3 py-1 text-xs mb-4">In Uw Eigen Huisstijl</span><h3 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-medium text-primary-950 mb-4 text-pretty">Jouw merk, jouw ervaring</h3><p class="text-base text-primary-700 text-balance">Pas kleuren en logo's zorgen ervoor dat alles voelt als jouw zorgorganisatie. Cliënten zien jouw naam.</p><!----></div><figure class="md:order-1"><div class="bg-primary-100 rounded-xl aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden"><img data-nuxt-img srcset="/_amplify/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ftelehealth_video_call_workflow_1.jpg&amp;w=1536&amp;q=100 1x, /_amplify/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ftelehealth_video_call_workflow_2.jpg&amp;w=1536&amp;q=100 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute(&#39;data-error&#39;, 1)" alt="Jouw merk, jouw ervaring" class="w-full h-full object-contain" src="/_amplify/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ftelehealth_video_call_workflow_3.jpg&amp;w=1536&amp;q=100"></div></figure></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 lg:gap-20 items-center"><div class="max-w-md"><span class="inline-block font-medium rounded-full bg-primary-100 text-primary-800 px-3 py-1 text-xs mb-4">Multi-Channel</span><h3 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-medium text-primary-950 mb-4 text-pretty">SMS, e-mail en portaallevering</h3><p class="text-base text-primary-700 text-balance">Lever contactmomenten via het kanaal dat de cliënt verkiest. SMS voor snelheid, e-mail voor details.</p><!----></div><figure class=""><div class="bg-primary-100 rounded-xl aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden"><img data-nuxt-img srcset="/_amplify/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ftelehealth_video_call_workflow_4.jpg&amp;w=1536&amp;q=100 1x, /_amplify/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ftelehealth_video_call_workflow_1.jpg&amp;w=1536&amp;q=100 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute(&#39;data-error&#39;, 1)" alt="SMS, e-mail en portaallevering" class="w-full h-full object-contain" src="/_amplify/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ftelehealth_video_call_workflow_1.jpg&amp;w=1536&amp;q=100"></div></figure></div><!--]--></div><!--]--><!----></div></div><!--]--></section><section class="py-8 md:py-24 bg-primary-100/50"><!--[--><div class="w-full max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4"><!--[--><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-6 gap-8 md:gap-16 lg:gap-24 items-center"><figure class="order-2 md:col-span-4 space-y-4 md:space-y-6"><blockquote class="text-xl sm:text-2xl lg:text-3xl xl:text-4xl max-w-full sm:max-w-[40ch] font-medium text-primary-900 text-pretty tracking-tight [&amp;_i]:not-italic [&amp;_i]:bg-gradient-to-r [&amp;_i]:from-primary-200/70 [&amp;_i]:to-primary-300/70 [&amp;_i]:px-1 [&amp;_i]:-mx-1 [&amp;_i]:rounded [&amp;_i]:box-decoration-clone [&amp;_i]:border-r-4 [&amp;_i]:border-primary-400">"Een cliënt die extra aandacht nodig heeft krijgt direct contact. Alles loopt veilig en geautomatiseerd."</blockquote><figcaption class="md:order-2"><cite class="text-sm sm:text-base font-medium text-primary-950 not-italic">Ralph Van der Pol</cite><p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-primary-600">Oprichter Beeldzorgteam</p></figcaption><a href="https://kuduzorg.com" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="inline-block"><img data-nuxt-img srcset="/_amplify/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fkuduzorg-logo.png&amp;w=1536&amp;q=100 1x, /_amplify/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fkuduzorg-logo.pn